sections:

#### prop_section ####
kind: proposition
----
statement: If two numbers measure any number, then the least number measured by them also measures the same.
----
proof:

Let the two numbers *A* and *B* measure any number *CD,* and let *E* be the least that they measure.

I say that *E* also measures *CD.*

<figure class="diagram">
